      {
        "id": 17679,
        "title": "Metody",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 149910,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jak dotąd obiekty, które utworzyliśmy na podstawie klas, nie mogą wykonywać żadnych działań w naszej grze.</p><p>Dodając <strong>metody</strong> do klas, będziemy mogli tworzyć interaktywne obiekty gry za pomocą klas używanych jako szablony.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 149911,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodawanie metody w klasie przypomina tworzenie zwykłej funkcji, z tą różnicą, że nie trzeba używać słowa kluczowego <code>function</code>.</p><p>Ta klasa <code>Player</code> nie potrafi jeszcze zbyt wiele. Dodajmy do niej za pomocą metody możliwość otrzymywania obrażeń.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"70\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"72\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>takeDamage</code>, następnie <code>()</code>, a potem <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 149912,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wewnątrz nawiasów klamrowych metody działają jak zwykłe funkcje.</p><p>Użyjmy <code>console.log</code>, aby wyświetlić komunikat w konsoli, gdy wywołana zostanie funkcja <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"90\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>console.log</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 149913,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zanim będziemy mogli użyć metody <code>takeDamage()</code>, musimy utworzyć nowy obiekt na podstawie klasy.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"112\" /><option startIndex=\"113\" endIndex=\"119\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"125\" /><option startIndex=\"126\" endIndex=\"132\" /><option startIndex=\"132\" endIndex=\"133\" /><option startIndex=\"133\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"139\" /><option startIndex=\"139\" endIndex=\"140\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>const</code>, następnie <code>player</code>, a potem <code>=</code>, <code>new</code>, <code>Player</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>\"Ryu\"</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 149914,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Aby użyć metody <code>takeDamage()</code>, potrzebujesz nazwy obiektu, kropki, nazwy metody i nawiasów.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Ryu.takeDamage()\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"player.takeDamage\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"141\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{ \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>player.takeDamage();</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 149915,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Parametry sprawiają, że metody klas mogą być bardziej interaktywne, reagując na przekazywane im wartości.</p><p>Dodaj parametr o nazwie <code>amount</code> do metody <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"71\" endIndex=\"77\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ouch!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>amount</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 149916,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dzięki instrukcji warunkowej tworzone przez nas obiekty będą mogły reagować na ilość obrażeń przekazywanych do <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><p>Dokończ dodawanie instrukcji, która sprawdza, czy <code>amount</code> ma określoną wartość.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"101\" /><option startIndex=\"136\" endIndex=\"140\" /><option startIndex=\"146\" endIndex=\"171\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Big hit!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Small hit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>if (amount === 10)</code>, następnie <code>else</code> i na końcu <code>console.log(\"Small hit\");</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 149917,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Każdy nowy obiekt utworzony przez nas z klasy <code>Player</code> będzie mógł używać metody <code>takeDamage()</code>.</p><p>Wywołaj ponownie <code>takeDamage()</code>, ale tym razem przekaż do niej <code>10</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"233\" endIndex=\"235\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Player\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(name) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".name = name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" takeDamage(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (amount === \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Big hit!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  } \" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"   \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Small hit&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Player(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player.takeDamage(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>10</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 149918,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Który z tych sposobów poprawnie rozpoczyna tworzenie metody o nazwie <code>update</code> wewnątrz klasy?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>update()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>function update()</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>update()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 149919,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Czy wywołanie metody klasy może zwrócić wartość?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Tak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nie</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz Tak.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 149920,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co z poniższych stwierdzeń dotyczących klas i metod jest prawdziwe?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Obiekty utworzone na podstawie klasy mają dostęp do jej metod</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Obiekty nie mają dostępu do metod w klasie</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Obiekty utworzone na podstawie klasy mają dostęp do jej metod.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 149921,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj poprawną wersję metody, która sprawdza zdrowie gracza.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"healthLevel:\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"94\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerHUD\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(playerName) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".playerName = playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" healthLevel() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>healthLevel()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 149922,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zakoduj poprawny sposób użycia metody klasowej z <code>PlayerHUD</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"134\" endIndex=\"137\" /><option startIndex=\"137\" endIndex=\"138\" /><option startIndex=\"138\" endIndex=\"149\" /><option startIndex=\"149\" endIndex=\"150\" /><option startIndex=\"150\" endIndex=\"151\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"PlayerHUD\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(playerName) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".playerName = playerName;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" healthLevel() {}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" hud = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" PlayerHUD(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Ryu&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"hud.healthLevel();\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>hud</code>, następnie <code>.</code>, a potem <code>healthLevel</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 149923,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dokończ kodowanie metody, która zwiększa wynik gracza.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"73\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"74\" /><option startIndex=\"74\" endIndex=\"75\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" increase() {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>increase</code>, następnie <code>(</code> i na końcu <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 149924,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wywołaj metodę <code>increase</code> z argumentem <code>5</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"score.increase = 5;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"143\" endIndex=\"161\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Score\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"constructor\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\"(points) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points = points;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" increase(amount) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"this\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\".points += amount;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" }\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" score = \" /><text value=\"new\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" Score(\" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"score.increase(\" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(score);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>score.increase(5);</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
